# --- Block the parked build folder --------------------------------------------
# _build/ and studio/ are working folders, not pages, but Netlify deploys the
# whole repo and WAS serving every file in them: the internal handoff docs in
# _build/handoffs/ were readable at their exact URL (verified live 2026-11-17).
# Directory listing is off, so only exact-filename guesses reached them, but
# nothing stopped a crawler that found one. The `!` is required: without it a
# real file on disk wins over a redirect rule, which is exactly the case here.
/_build/*   /404.html   404!
/studio/*   /404.html   404!

